  "body": "Hello, I am having problems with my matrix server. The connection is down to my element chat, but when I log into my vps and restart server it looks good and running and I can even register new users. what am I missing?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI tried:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsynctl restart\r\n\r\nstopped synapse.app.homeserver\r\n\r\nWaiting for processes to exit...\r\n\r\nAll processes exited\r\n\r\nThis server is configured to use '[matrix.org](https://matrix.org/)' as its trusted key server via the\r\n\r\n'trusted_key_servers' config option. '[matrix.org](https://matrix.org/)' is a good choice for a key\r\n\r\nserver since it is long-lived, stable and trusted. However, some admins may\r\n\r\nwish to use another server for this purpose.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTo suppress this warning and continue using '[matrix.org](https://matrix.org/)', admins should set\r\n\r\n'suppress_key_server_warning' to 'true' in homeserver.yaml.\r\n\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nstarted synapse.app.homeserver(homeserver.yaml)\r\n```\r\n\r\nStill no connection",
